  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UKR-EQUANOMICS: Making public finance work for women&#x2019;s economic empowerment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EQUANOMICS supports governments to reform fiscal policy so that tax and spending actively reduce gender gaps, especially in work, entrepreneurship, assets and time poverty, while strengthening gender responsive public finance and debt management. This initiative will contribute to the EQUANOMICS portfolio, providing targeted technical assistance to Ukraine, Honduras, Egypt and Bhutan, supporting each country in adopting transformative public finance strategies that promote gender equality, with</narrative>
  </description>
